    "localizationTests.probe": {
      "comment": "Not user-facing. Exists only so LocalizationTests can prove the resource-bundle plumbing (Bundle.module -> OpenZonr_OpenZonrApp.bundle -> de.lproj) against a real compiled entry, without coupling to product wording that might change for unrelated reasons.",
